lanation":"La consistencia entre usuarios se logra con configuración compartida (Proyecto o Skill) en lugar de prompts individuales.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"A sales team wants every member to prepare proposals with the same structure and quality using Claude. Which design gives consistency across users?","options":["Each using a different model","A shared Project or a Skill with the template, instructions and reference material","Each salesperson writing their own prompt in their personal style and experience","Everyone using personal memory"],"explanation":"Consistency across users comes from shared configuration (Project or Skill) instead of individual prompts."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"Un responsable de IT debe explicar a la dirección qué puede hacer Claude en un proyecto de documentación técnica. ¿Qué dos elementos debe incluir? (Elige 2)","options":["La supervisión humana que se mantendrá","Lo que Claude puede hacer de forma fiable y lo que no","La promesa de que no habrá errores","Que Claude sustituirá al equipo técnico","Que no hace falta formación"],"correct":[0,1],"explanation":"Una buena comunicación cubre capacidades y límites, supervisión mantenida y resultados realistas, sin exagerar ni infravalorar.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"An IT manager must explain to leadership what Claude can do in a technical documentation project. Which two elements should be included? (Choose 2)","options":["The human oversight that will be retained","What Claude can and can't reliably do","A promise that there will be no errors","That Claude will replace the technical team","That no training is needed"],"explanation":"Good communication covers capabilities and limits, retained oversight and realistic outcomes, without over- or understating."}}},{"domain":"D4","source":"bank","stem":"Una responsable de compras quiere automatizar la comparación mensual de ofertas. Hoy lo hace a mano con prompts distintos cada vez. ¿Qué elementos debe tener el flujo repetible?","opti